  abstract = {Handwritten Text Recognition (HTR) is a computer process that aims to obtain digital text equivalent to the content of the image of a physical handwritten document. Based on Github, HTR-United invites the community of users to decompartmentalize data sourced from different HTR platforms in order to reduce the costs of producing such data. This solution proposes an operational model that could offer a framework for the construction of data papers for HTR, and even the beginnings of a standardization for this type of publication.},
